  "translation": "一格设计 was founded in 2016 and is based by Suzhou Creek in Shanghai. We are a specialist brand design agency, providing brand strategy, visual design, packaging design and other services to clients in China and abroad. Our clients range from brands with decades of history to new brands just starting out. We are a young, international team of more than twenty people from cities in China and abroad. Here, every good idea has a chance to become real work. As our business grows, we are now recruiting a junior designer, based in Shanghai. Duties: 1. Visual design for brand projects, including posters, packaging and social media images. 2. Working with senior designers to complete design proposals, and taking part in discussing and revising them. 3. Keeping in good contact with clients and completing work on time. Requirements: 1. A degree or above in design or a related subject; this year's graduates welcome. 2. Skilled in common design software. 3. A good eye, good communication skills and a sense of responsibility, and able to handle a fairly fast pace of work. 4. Internship experience in brand design or at an advertising agency preferred. 5. Ability to read work materials in English preferred. We offer: a competitive salary, full social insurance and housing fund, paid annual leave, flexible hours, and the chance to work with an international team. Every new employee has one-to-one mentoring from an experienced designer. If you're interested, please send your CV and portfolio to our recruitment email address by 31 March, with 'Junior designer application + your name' in the subject line. We will contact suitable candidates within a week of receiving applications.",
